{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/LaserTagMassacreLOGO.png?t=1742334240\" /><strong><i> <br> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><br>   </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Laser Tag Massacre\u00a0</i></strong>is a narrative-driven survival horror game inspired by 80s slasher movies, featuring a retro PS1-style aesthetic.  <br> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/VHSCOVERGIF.gif?t=1742334240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>A Deadly Game Begins...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Halloween night, five friends throw a party in an abandoned arcade deep in rural Campinas, Brazil. What starts as a fun night of laser tag quickly turns into a fight for survival.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/DanielaGIF.gif?t=1742334240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Variety of\u00a0Mini-Games...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the horror builds, enjoy a variety of fun mini-games scattered throughout the arcade :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/HockeyGIF.gif?t=1742334240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Will You Survive?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the arcade, play mini-games, but remember: the real horror is never far away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/ArenaGIF.gif?t=1742334240\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579960?t=1742334240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/109ca3d889140f220d5ebbc762abecdf25a42987/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742334240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/a45c679633c0a0e9a85288eb8f6b0f0aff5cd5a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742334240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/a45c679633c0a0e9a85288eb8f6b0f0aff5cd5a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742334240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Graphic Violence: The game features intense combat and action scenes with explicit violence, including dismemberment and bloody injuries.\r\n\r\nPsychological and Emotional Themes: The storyline may involve elements of mental disorders, psychological torture, and pursuit."},"demos":[{"appid":3593480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/LaserTagMassacreLOGO.png?t=1742334240\" /><strong><i> <br> </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i><br>   </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Laser Tag Massacre\u00a0</i></strong>is a narrative-driven survival horror game inspired by 80s slasher movies, featuring a retro PS1-style aesthetic.  <br> <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579960/extras/VHSCOVERGIF.gif?t=1742334240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>A Deadly Game Begins...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On Halloween night, five friends throw a party in an abandoned arcade deep in rural Campinas, Brazil. What starts as a fun night of laser tag quickl